# Scripted route through the garden (examples/topdown). Used by the
# example_topdown_playthrough test; must complete the level with no script errors.
#
# Up the path to the key (the top wall stops the hero, so the hold time is
# not critical; gem 1 is on the way), back down to the gate row, right
# through the opened gate to the east wall (gems 2 and 3), then down to the stairs.
200 move_up
76 move_down
10 -
300 move_right
120 move_down
